<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>We have not authorized anyone to provide you
with information different from that contained or incorporated by reference in this prospectus. The Selling Stockholder&nbsp;may offer
to sell, and seek offers to buy, shares of our common stock only in jurisdictions where offers and sales are permitted. The information
contained in this prospectus is accurate only as of the date of this prospectus, regardless of the time of delivery of this prospectus
or of any sale of common stock.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">In this prospectus, the &ldquo;Company,&rdquo; &ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo;
&ldquo;our&rdquo; and &ldquo;Adial&rdquo; refer to Adial Pharmaceuticals, Inc.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B></B></P>

