    <TD STYLE="width: 94%; padding-right: 0.8pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">we shall have no knowledge of any event more likely than not to have the effect of causing the effectiveness of the registration statement to be suspended or the prospectus or any prospectus supplement thereto failing to meet the requirement of Sections 5(b) or 10 of the Securities Act of 1933, as amended (which event is more likely than not to occur within the fifteen (15) business days following the Business Day on which such Purchase Notice is deemed delivered; and</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0.8pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0.8pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0.8pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
