    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0.8pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Applicable percentage ownership is based on 29,941,982 shares of our
common stock outstanding as of June 20, 2023, which includes the 199,620 Commitment Shares.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

